- \( S \cap C \) as the percentage of students who are members of both the swim team and the chess club.
From the problem, we know:
1. \( S \cap C = 24\% \) (24% of all students are members of both the chess club and the swim team).
2. 20% of the swim team members are not members of the chess club.
We need to find the percentage of all Daifu students who are members of the swim team (\( S \)).
