\]
This is not enough to cover 10 types of books.
### Option B: \( L = 4 \)
\[
\text{Total Codes} = 4 + \frac{4(4-1)}{2} = 4 + \frac{4 \times 3}{2} = 4 + 6 = 10
\]
This is exactly 10, which is sufficient.
